sh_Republic\" title=\"British Republic\">British Republic</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Poland2.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Poland2.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/a/a6/Flag_of_Poland2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/23?cb=20150815024353\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Poland\" title=\"Poland\">Poland</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of the Republic of China.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/2b/Flag_of_the_Republic_of_China.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/23?cb=20170812180045\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/China\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"China\">Republic of China</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"plainlist\" style=\"padding-left: 0.6em; text-align: left;\"><b>NATO:</b> \n<ul><li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Denmark.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Denmark.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/im