td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Disestablished\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2055\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>Allies of World War III</b>, were the countries that together opposed the <a href=\"/wiki/Eurasian_Coalition\" title=\"Eurasian Coalition\">Coalition forces</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/World_War_III\" title=\"World War III\">Third World War</a> (2051–2055). The Allies promoted the alliance as seeking to stop Turkish, and Japanese aggression.\n</p><p>The leaders of the \"Big Four\" – the United States, Poland, China, and Britain – controlled Allied strategy; relations between Britain and the United States were especially close.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Major_affiliated_combatants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Major affiliated combatants</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#United_States_of_America\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>United States of America</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Poland\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Poland</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Britain\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Britain</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#China\"><s